@base = http://localhost:8000/api/v1
@token = paste-parent-access-token
@student = 1
@main = 1
@savings = 2
@card = 1

### School limits + my override + effective result
GET {{base}}/students/{{student}}/spending-controls/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Product catalogue (to choose blocked items / categories)
GET {{base}}/product-categories/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
GET {{base}}/products/?page_size=100
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Merchants I can block
GET {{base}}/merchants/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create an override (tighten only; loosening -> 400 policy_cannot_loosen)
POST {{base}}/policies/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "student": {{student}}, "daily_spend_cap": "3000", "blocked_categories": [], "blocked_items": [], "blocked_merchants": [], "p2p_enabled": false }

### Change it (use the override's id from spending-controls)
PATCH {{base}}/policies/4/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "daily_spend_cap": "2500" }
